# Agent configuration is tracked on purpose.
#
# The skills, their lockfile and the local settings are how this repository is
# worked on, and they lived only on one laptop — a reinstall took the setup with
# it and left CLAUDE.md describing skills nobody had. They are text, they are
# small, and none of them holds a credential.
#
# `.claude/worktrees/` is the exception and stays out: it is a gigabyte of
# checked-out copies of this same repository.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.local.json
!.claude/memory/

# Generated from the running Nest metadata by `pnpm openapi:emit`. Not
# committed while most operations still declare no response type — a
# checked-in artifact that is more than half empty invites being trusted.
backend/openapi.json
packages/shared/src/types/openapi.ts
